   7:Source/html/readability.c ****  * Lua reference received) and emits DocBlocks into a DocParseResult. Blocks,
   8:Source/html/readability.c ****  * inlines and strings are allocated from a DocArena owned by the result —
   9:Source/html/readability.c ****  * identical lifetime model to document.c's walker output, so document_free
